# The sdist ships tests/ by default; the distributed tree must be
# self-consistent — every file the shipped tests read must ship.
# tests/test_release_sync.py loads the release tooling by path and copies
# the whole tools/ tree into its synthetic roots; tests/test_frame_receipts.py
# and tests/test_installs.py read the frame document and the filed evidence
# runs under docs/. Ship exactly those trees. (G-4)
graft tools
graft docs/evidence
include docs/governance-frame.md
include tests/fixtures/installs/eight-class-golden.jsonl
